<title>ALGERIA: Bomb kills seven, wounds 37 in Algiers.</title>
<headline>Bomb kills seven, wounds 37 in Algiers.</headline>
<dateline>ALGIERS 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bomb killed seven people and wounded 37 in the Algerian capital early on Monday, security forces said.</p>
<p>The bomb, the third in two days, went off in the inner city working class district of Bab El-Oued. It coincided with the final day of campaigning for Thursday's general election meant to end years of bloodshed which officials blame on Moslem fundamentalists.</p>
